Current Behavior: co-applicant-consent.js sends consent_token in JSON body with only the apikey header (no Authorization bearer token, because the invited member is unauthenticated). However, deployed request-upload-url has verify_jwt: true at the Supabase Edge Gateway, rejecting the request with HTTP 401 (Missing authorization header) and showing "Could not initialize document upload."

